        "headline": "Winter Weather Advisory issued July 25 at 3:03PM AKDT until July 27 at 4:00AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Mixed precipitation expected. Total snow accumulations\nbetween 2 and 6 inches and ice accumulations around a light glaze.\n\n* WHERE...Central Brooks Range.\n\n* WHEN...From 10 AM Sunday to 4 AM AKDT Monday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel may be impacted.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Precipitation may start as rain before\nchanging to snow with a brief period of wintry mix in between.\nWidespread 2 inches of snow accumulation is expected with up to 6\ninches possible at higher elevations. Snow diminishes Sund",
